alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 173% of normal in April to May but only 31% in July to August. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 35% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every one of the 6 grids had its driest year in 1963, and grid 19362 got 55% of normal that year.</p>"}
